It is Saturday morning.
The weather is nice today.
I ride my bicycle to the weekly market.
The market is nearby.
I am there quickly.
There are already many people here.
I park my bicycle on the street.
Then I lock it.
I have a backpack.
Inside are two cloth bags.
I take the bags in my hand.
Today I am buying many things for my flat.
I need groceries for the weekend.
The market is really very large.
I see many stalls.
There are beautiful colours everywhere.
I also hear many voices.
The vendors call out loudly.
It is loud, but I like that.
I walk slowly into the crowd.
